# Sword of the Meek is already on Llanowar Elves and Skullclamp is not when Thorin enters (turn 5), and both are targeted. The Sword
# stays put (CR 701.3b) but Skullclamp becomes attached, which is enough: the Elves, now 1/1 +1/+2 +1/-1 = 3/2, deal 3 damage (their
# power, not Thorin's) to Bot2's Ulvenwald Oddity, which survives with 3 damage.

